<title>USA: Payco American Corp Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>Payco American Corp Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.04		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			    388		    1,203</p>
<p> Revs			46,031		   44,818</p>
